# #154 (US-006) compiled fixture .gitignore.
#
# Only `target/manifest.json` — the scrubbed `dbt compile` output committed by
# US-006 — survives. The negation overrides the parent
# `tests/fixtures/.gitignore` rule `dbt_project_*/target/manifest.json` (which
# is meant for the parse-only small/medium fixtures that commit
# `manifest_v<N>.json` instead). This project commits `manifest.json` directly
# so `signalforge.manifest.load(fixture_dir)` finds it at the default path.
!target/manifest.json

# Everything else `dbt deps && dbt compile` leaves behind is reproducible.
dbt_packages/
dev.duckdb
logs/
.user.yml
target/partial_parse.msgpack
target/perf_info.json
target/semantic_manifest.json
target/graph.gpickle
target/graph_summary.json
target/run_results.json
target/compiled/
target/run/
